Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.13,0:00:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going on a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.50,0:00:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What?{\Yes?}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.79,0:00:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.49,0:00:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, "Aah."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.66,0:00:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what's this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.51,0:00:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This kind of lovey dovey event between lovey dovey lovers is something you'd see in a manga!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.36,0:00:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with this! I'm not happy at all. I don't want this. In fact, it's just scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.88,0:00:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.19,0:00:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I said, say "Aah."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.25,0:00:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,A-Aah...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.87,0:00:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.78,0:00:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to see that you're smiling...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.22,0:00:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, there's some rice on your cheek.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.47,0:00:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You put it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.01,0:01:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take it off for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.21,0:01:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, all gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.79,0:01:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, we're going on a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.28,0:01:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No... that's not what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.34,0:01:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A date...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.60,0:01:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you... go on a date with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.00,0:01:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,How about... we go... on a date?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.26,0:01:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What, are you against it, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.76,0:01:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... I'm not against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.01,0:01:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, then go on a date with me, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.89,0:01:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So it ultimately comes down to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.12,0:01:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any complaints... rather, any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.04,0:01:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,None.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.90,0:01:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.24,0:01:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Then after school I'll make some excuse to go home early and get ready, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.85,0:02:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, come to my house once you're done preparing for the cultural festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.37,0:02:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.16,0:02:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fscx95}That's how today, June 13th, would come to be celebrated as the day I went on my first date with my girlfriend...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.61,0:02:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,or so I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.46,0:04:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I talked a bit too long with Sengoku\Nand Hanekawa at the school gates...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.68,0:04:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm a bit late...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.36,0:04:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You're earlier than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.79,0:04:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.69,0:04:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, we're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.11,0:04:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.35,0:04:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.33,0:04:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.78,0:04:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're pretty quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.91,0:04:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you understand the situation we're in right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.42,0:04:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.91,0:04:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,When is "now"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.51,0:04:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you spelling "situation"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.17,0:04:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not where context comes from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.25,0:05:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,My girlfriend's father is with us on our first date... This isn't a date; it's torture.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.71,0:05:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly was I celebrating?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.11,0:05:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd be nervous, Araragi-kun, since this is our first date,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.21,0:05:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,but you won't make it at this rate. The night is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.53,0:05:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.14,0:05:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not nervous because this is my first date!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.97,0:05:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.38,0:05:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you... love me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.10,0:05:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me. Do you... love me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.92,0:05:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this, you won't answer me? Could it be that you don't love me, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.10,0:05:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.21,0:05:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. I love you too, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.15,0:05:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you... very much...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.15,0:05:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.94,0:05:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, you really {\i1}are{\i0\fscx140} {\r}quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.11,0:05:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're being unusually taciturn. Normally you chat with me more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.94,0:05:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be that you're in a bad mood today?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.70,0:06:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It has nothing to do with my mood...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.86,0:06:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, so your head is sluggish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.92,0:06:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You're taking advantage of my confusion to say whatever you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.74,0:06:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, your jabs are always\Nenergetic, even when other things aren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.55,0:06:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then I'll be nice and give you a topic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.82,0:06:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You can just answer, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.39,0:06:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you like about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.56,0:06:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The parts I {\i1}don't{\i0\fscx140} {\r}like are obvious!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.19,0:06:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.52,0:06:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I was seriously looking forward to this! It was like a dream come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.19,0:06:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,A dream? That's going overboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.04,0:06:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.99,0:06:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,When you look up the words "Vain"\Nand "Person"... oh, what was it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.61,0:06:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's probably me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.48,0:06:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Senjougahara, seriously, what are you planning?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.71,0:06:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.33,0:06:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you be referring to me, or was that directed at Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.89,0:06:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, Araragi-kun is addressing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.49,0:06:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hitagi-san! I was addressing Hitagi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.32,0:07:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.82,0:07:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So you won't use {\i1}my{\i0\fscx140} {\r}first name. Not that I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.23,0:07:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Hitagi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.01,0:07:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take the liberty of asking you again, but what are you planning? What are you scheming?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.47,0:07:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not scheming anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.02,0:07:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Araragi-kun,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.12,0:07:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fscx95}there's a famous mystery author by the name of Kuriowa Ruiko, but if you break up the characters in her name,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.52,0:07:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,it becomes "Wicked Bad Child."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.64,0:07:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think that was intentional?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.51,0:07:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care about something like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.50,0:07:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wicked child and bad child are both referring to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.05,0:07:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure say cruel things in front of my parent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.26,0:07:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, it seems your child is a wicked child and a bad child.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.07,0:07:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you got quiet again. I guess I teased you a bit too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.85,0:07:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, you react so easily that I only want to depress you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.57,0:07:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Those words just depressed me the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.63,0:08:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So what parts do you like about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.78,0:08:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That you're nice,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.15,0:08:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,you're cute,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.56,0:08:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,and you come to my rescue, like a prince, whenever I'm in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.53,0:08:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything I said before was my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.16,0:08:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of trash, I mean Araragi-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.60,0:08:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you about to call your boyfriend "trash" right there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.85,0:08:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying? Don't accuse me of something I wouldn't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.26,0:08:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway Araragi-kun, how did you do on the last test?{\"ability test", same thing}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.02,0:08:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, I took care of you day and night at my house, just the two of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.94,0:08:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you intentionally say it like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.41,0:08:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So? How was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.96,0:08:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I scored better than expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.13,0:08:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I even got a better score in math, which was supposed to be my best subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.15,0:08:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to your help. Thank you, Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.79,0:09:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Father? It seems that Araragi-kun wants to thank you, so could you listen to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.89,0:09:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you Hitagi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.46,0:09:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It would've been better if we could've gone over the answers right after the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.03,0:09:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, asking that much of you at\Nthis point is a bit too demanding, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.14,0:09:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Though it's a little ironic to say this, since I was the one who tutored you, I'm a little surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.71,0:09:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it surprising?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.66,0:09:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, considering it's you, it wasn't very amusing or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.17,0:09:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't get tutored by you to get laughs, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.87,0:09:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fscx95}I was really looking forward to a situation like, "I studied so hard, but my scores were actually worse than usual!"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.95,0:09:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,In some ways, I'm disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.38,0:09:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Asking for something like that is much more demanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.45,0:09:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.61,0:09:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's really amazing. I compliment you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.13,0:09:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, you might be able to do even {\i1}better{\i0}, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.64,0:09:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Better, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.98,0:09:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'd like, it's fine with me if I tutor you from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.91,0:09:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.41,0:10:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,the best deal possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.71,0:10:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.78,0:10:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Then every day from now on, you will come to my house for tutoring.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.76,0:10:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,E-Every day?! Do smart people really study that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.46,0:10:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No, obviously this program is designed for you, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.27,0:10:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Smart people are smart before they even start studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.33,0:10:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like Hanekawa studies every day, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.42,0:10:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, the "studying" that Hanekawa-san does,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.56,0:10:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,unfortunately, is on a completely different level than our "studying."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.65,0:10:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanekawa-san is the real thing. She's from a different world than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.22,0:10:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's not like Hanekawa always aces tests, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.23,0:11:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If Hanekawa-san can't score 100, then the problem is with the test. I wonder what that's like, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.22,0:11:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,When I think about how much pressure that must be, I can't honestly say that I'm jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.74,0:11:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Pressure, huh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.65,0:11:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Or stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.64,0:11:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Stress, huh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.40,0:11:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, since you're crawling at rock bottom and can't even imagine those really smart people, Araragi-kun,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.56,0:11:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,you're just going to have to put in\Nmore and more effort, then try harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.15,0:11:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why, from now on, every day, there will be tutoring at my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.45,0:11:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.86,0:11:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe Kanbaru's house would be fine too, once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.60,0:11:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What does Kanbaru have to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.69,0:11:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to play with her a bit, too. I promised her that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.56,0:11:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, you'd want to play with Kanbaru too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.42,0:11:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, she's an interesting person.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.31,0:11:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, about Kanbaru...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.55,0:11:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Kanbaru?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.71,0:11:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Why's she so erotic?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.78,0:12:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Erotic? Kanbaru?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.28,0:12:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying she's not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.33,0:12:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fscx90}Even {\i1}Oshino{\i0\fscx140} {\r\fscx90}seemed to recognize her as an erotic person rather than as an athletic person when I talked to him before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.78,0:12:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Maybe it only seems like that from a male's point of view.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.03,0:12:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just true to herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.16,0:12:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.89,0:12:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Personally, I can't overlook the fact that my cute junior is being given a label like "erotic."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.26,0:12:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what are you going to do if you can't overlook it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.89,0:12:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,"What will I do?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.12,0:12:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll warp the basis for your decision, the very foundation of your values.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.33,0:12:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Kanbaru will actually appear to be an innocent, pure-hearted girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.59,0:13:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sto—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.33,0:13:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,...and, that just about does it, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.19,0:13:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do whatever you want, Hitagi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.63,0:13:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.68,0:13:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, wait here for a bit. I'll go on ahead alone and prepare.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.85,0:13:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.17,0:13:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a chat with Father or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.21,0:13:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun... was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.84,0:13:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes. I'm Araragi Koyomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.83,0:14:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. Take good care of my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.23,0:14:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.49,0:14:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, you might have heard, but I'm the model businessman.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.55,0:14:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I have hardly any time to spend with Hitagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.19,0:14:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.21,0:14:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So this might not mean much, but it's been a long time since I've seen Hitagi having so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.11,0:14:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You've already heard about Hitagi's mother, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.13,0:14:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.27,0:14:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And about Hitagi's condition too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.88,0:14:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.05,0:14:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's not the only reason, and of course it's in no small part my fault for having prioritized my job,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.29,0:14:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,but Hitagi closed her heart to others long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.09,0:15:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Though recently, for the first time in a while, in a long while, Hitagi has asked me for favors.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.23,0:15:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,She wanted me to let her help with my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.42,0:15:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And now this. Both times, you were involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.81,0:15:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you're quite something, Araragi-kun, to be able to change her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.60,0:15:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems you think very highly of me, and I'm honored, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.73,0:15:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it was all coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.40,0:15:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? I heard that you had a hand in curing Hitagi of her condition, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.62,0:15:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I said, I don't think it was necessarily me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.44,0:15:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, Hitagi-san saved herself. I was just there to see her through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.37,0:15:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all you have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.90,0:15:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,More than anything else, I am thankful that you were there for her when she needed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.06,0:15:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a failure as a father. I wasn't there when she needed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.07,0:16:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, even though I'm a failure of a father, I'm quite proud of my daughter. I trust her judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.93,0:16:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're the man that she chose, then there's no argument.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.23,0:16:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Take good care of my daughter, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.56,0:16:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.61,0:16:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.07,0:16:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, from here on it'll just be us young people. Thanks for driving us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.04,0:16:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be back in about two hours,\Nso please go ahead and work until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.14,0:16:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.30,0:16:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.94,0:16:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.05,0:17:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Senjougahara, how much longer are we going to walk like th—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.42,0:17:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.61,0:17:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look up yet, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.95,0:17:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Close your eyes and lie down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.95,0:17:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You can open your eyes now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.06,0:18:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.39,0:18:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing, I seriously can't put it into words.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.11,0:18:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So you have poor vocabulary skills?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.62,0:18:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Deneb, Altair, Vega.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.88,0:18:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The famous Summer Triangle, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.63,0:18:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,From there, pan to the side, and that\Narea is Ophiuchus, the "snake-holder."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.30,0:18:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So Serpentis would be the stars lined up around there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.62,0:18:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That remarkably bright one over there is Spica, so that area is Virgo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.51,0:18:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there is Cancer, well, I guess it's a little hard to see...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.58,0:18:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.89,0:18:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.64,0:18:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything that I have, all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.27,0:19:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The opportunity to tutor you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.81,0:19:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,a cute junior, a clumsy father,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.92,0:19:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and this starry sky...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.35,0:19:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the only things I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.88,0:19:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The only things I can give you, Araragi-kun, are things like these.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.30,0:19:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.73,0:19:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.30,0:19:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, technically, I also have my insults and verbal assaults.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.93,0:19:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.43,0:19:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, there's this thing called my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.92,0:19:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you not want that, either?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.05,0:19:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.82,0:19:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know, I was almost violated by a perverted man, once.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.28,0:19:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.45,0:19:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I'm scared of doing what\Nthat pervert tried to do to me with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.46,0:19:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, I'm really afraid... of disliking you, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.67,0:20:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, I'm afraid... of losing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.82,0:20:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though I can't say my life up until now was fortunate,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.92,0:20:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,if I got your attention because I was so unfortunate, then I think it was okay, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.01,0:20:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how hard I've fallen for you, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.12,0:20:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why, I'll make something come of it, no matter what. So... I want you to wait just a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.55,0:20:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why, at this point in time, out of everything I can give to you, Araragi-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.76,0:20:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,for now... this starry sky is the greatest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.89,0:20:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I came here when I was a child; my father, my mother... and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.26,0:20:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.17,0:21:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Araragi-kun, do you love me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.61,0:21:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.86,0:21:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you too, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.23,0:21:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.70,0:21:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Which parts about me do you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.36,0:21:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I like everything about you. There's nothing I don't like.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.38,0:21:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so? I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.61,0:21:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How about you? Which parts do you like about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.32,0:21:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That you're nice, you're cute, and you come to my rescue, like a prince, whenever I'm in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.70,0:21:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.99,0:21:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it, since that pervert was only after my body, he didn't even try to take my lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.88,0:21:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why, Araragi-kun,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.10,0:21:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,we're going to kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.09,0:21:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No... that's not what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.52,0:21:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Could... could you... kiss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.65,0:22:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,How... how about... we kiss?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.16,0:22:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's kiss, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.05,0:22:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So it ultimately comes down to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.03,0:22:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how today became a day to be celebrated...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.73,0:22:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.87,0:23:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Karen!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.56,0:23:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Tsukihi!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.45,0:23:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Karen, you said you do Karate, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.42,0:24:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.38,0:24:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't karate and café latte similar?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.44,0:24:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,They are!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.99,0:24:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Just about as similar as chiropractics and plastic hand warmers, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.13,0:24:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They are! They're even more similar!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.76,0:24:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if they're related?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.99,0:24:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Possibly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.55,0:24:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be nice if they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.25,0:24:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be nice if they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.18,0:24:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Preview Quiz!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.89,0:24:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Quiz!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.63,0:24:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't quiz similar to cream cheese?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.84,0:24:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They are!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.37,0:24:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Just about as similar as beef stew and a meat hot pot, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.56,0:24:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They are!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.56,0:24:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Next episode: Tsubasa Cat part three.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.39,0:24:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't part three and Somo-san similar?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.92,0:24:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,They are!
